
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="kk">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Бозжыра — Білім әлемі</title>
<style>
:root{
  --blue:#2563eb;--dark:#142344;--sky:#eaf5ff;
  --yellow:#ffcc4d;--green:#21b573;--white:#fff;
  --muted:#71809a;--line:#e8eef7;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f7faff;color:var(--dark)}
button,a{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.navbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:#ffffffed;backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:14px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:900;font-size:17px}
.brand-icon{width:43px;height:43px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:15px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#3c82ff,#1747c7);color:white;font-size:24px;box-shadow:0 6px 16px #2563eb35}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:25px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#62718a}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--blue)}
.pill{border:0;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 17px;background:var(--blue);color:white;font-weight:800;box-shadow:0 6px 16px #2563eb30}
.hero{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:64px 22px 52px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:center;gap:36px}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-radius:30px;background:#e5efff;color:#2255bc;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;padding:9px 13px;letter-spacing:.6px}
h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5.5vw,66px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-2.5px;margin:22px 0 18px;font-weight:950}
h1 span{color:var(--blue)}
.hero p{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;max-width:500px}
.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}
.primary,.secondary{border:0;border-radius:15px;padding:15px 20px;font-weight:850;transition:.2s}
.primary{background:var(--blue);color:white;box-shadow:0 9px 20px #2563eb30}
.secondary{background:white;color:var(--dark);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.primary:hover,.secondary:hover,.pill:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.hero-art{min-height:350px;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:38px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#d8ecff,#eef6ff 60%,#fff0c7);overflow:hidden}
.sun{position:absolute;top:35px;right:48px;width:75px;height:75px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffcf58;box-shadow:0 0 0 15px #ffcf582b}
.cloud{position:absolute;font-size:46px;opacity:.8}
.cloud.one{left:26px;top:45px}.cloud.two{right:35px;top:135px;font-size:32px}
.land{position:absolute;bottom:-70px;border-radius:50% 50% 0 0;width:120%;height:190px;background:#8bd9a5;transform:rotate(-7deg)}
.land.back{bottom:-32px;left:-40px;height:130px;background:#65c98b;transform:rotate(10deg)}
.road{position:absolute;bottom:-35px;width:150px;height:230px;background:#536680;transform:rotate(25deg);border-radius:45px}
.road:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:69px;top:0;height:100%;border-left:5px dashed #fff6}
.school{position:relative;z-index:2;font-size:118px;filter:drop-shadow(0 12px 8px #1c386522);margin-top:-28px}
.floating{position:absolute;z-index:3;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ffffffa8;border-radius:18px;padding:13px 16px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #214c8420;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite}
.floating.a{left:18px;bottom:40px}.floating.b{right:17px;bottom:72px;animation-delay:1s}
@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-8px)}}
.stats{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto 40px;padding:0 22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
.stat{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px}
.stat-icon{width:48px;height:48px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:16px;background:#edf4ff;font-size:24px}
.stat strong{display:block;font-size:23px}.stat small{color:var(--muted);font-weight:650}
.section{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:55px 22px 75px}
.section-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px}
.section-head .eyebrow{margin-bottom:10px}
h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);letter-spacing:-1.2px;margin:12px 0}
.section-head p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin:0 auto;max-width:560px}
.levels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:19px}
.level-card{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:21px;transition:.25s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.level-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 18px 35px #214c8410}
.level-top{height:145px;border-radius:19px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:66px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.level-top:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:125px;height:125px;border:20px solid #ffffff45;border-radius:50%;right:-20px;bottom:-65px}
.t1{background:#e1efff}.t2{background:#fff0cb}.t3{background:#dff8e9}
.level-card h3{font-size:21px;margin:20px 0 8px}
.level-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;font-size:14px;min-height:46px}
.level-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#71809a;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;margin:18px 0}
.level-meta span:first-child{color:#d99500}
.level-button{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:13px;background:#edf4ff;color:#2054be;padding:13px;font-weight:850;transition:.2s}
.level-button:hover{background:var(--blue);color:white}
.level-completed .level-button{background:#e3f8ec;color:#13854b}
.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;align-items:stretch}
.about-card{padding:30px;border-radius:25px;background:#eaf3ff}
.about-card h3{font-size:25px;margin:0 0 12px}
.about-card p{line-height:1.8;color:#62718a}
.feature{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:flex-start;margin:19px 0}
.feature-icon{width:43px;height:43px;border-radius:14px;background:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:21px;flex-shrink:0}
.feature b{display:block;margin:3px 0 5px}.feature small{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
.about-note{border-radius:25px;background:var(--dark);color:white;padding:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.about-note .big-emoji{font-size:54px}
.about-note h3{font-size:27px;margin:15px 0 5px}
.about-note p{color:#c0cbe0;line-height:1.8}
footer{padding:28px 22px;text-align:center;background:white;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#101e3bcc;backdrop-filter:blur(7px);z-index:30;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px;overflow-y:auto}
.modal.open{display:flex}
.modal-box{background:white;border-radius:27px;width:min(100%,560px);padding:25px;box-shadow:0 25px 90px #06132d55;animation:pop .22s ease;max-height:95vh;overflow-y:auto}
@keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px) scale(.98)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.modal-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.modal-kicker{color:var(--blue);font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px}
.close{width:39px;height:39px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#f0f4fa;font-size:23px;color:#53627a}
.modal-progress{height:8px;background:#edf1f7;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin:17px 0 22px}
.modal-progress-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4387ff,#1b55db);border-radius:20px;transition:width .3s}
.modal-art{width:94px;height:94px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:27px;background:#eaf3ff;font-size:48px;margin:0 auto 17px}
.modal-question{text-align:center;font-size:23px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 22px}
.modal-answers{display:grid;gap:10px}
.modal-answer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-align:left;width:100%;padding:14px;border-radius:15px;background:white;border:2px solid #e7edf6;color:var(--dark);font-weight:750;line-height:1.4;transition:.15s}
.modal-answer:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:#7ca8ff;background:#f5f8ff}
.answer-emoji{font-size:23px;flex-shrink:0}
.answer-letter{margin-left:auto;color:#8996aa;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}
.modal-answer.correct{border-color:#25b878;background:#eafaf1}
.modal-answer.wrong{border-color:#f07878;background:#fff0f0}
.modal-answer:disabled{cursor:default}
.modal-feedback{text-align:center;min-height:27px;margin:14px 0 5px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:750}
.modal-feedback.good{color:#15965c}.modal-feedback.bad{color:#d24d4d}
.modal-next{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:15px;padding:15px;background:var(--blue);color:white;font-weight:850;margin-top:8px}
.modal-next:disabled{background:#cbd5e5;cursor:not-allowed}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translate(-50%,20px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;background:#152544;color:white;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:15px;z-index:50;box-shadow:0 12px 35px #0d1b3540;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;transition:.25s;text-align:center;width:max-content;max-width:90vw}
.toast.visible{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
body.modal-open{overflow:hidden}
@media(max-width:760px){
 .nav-links{gap:12px;font-size:12px}.nav-links a:nth-child(3){display:none}
 .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:42px;gap:28px}
 .hero-art{min-height:300px}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:9px}
 .stat{padding:14px}.levels{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:470px;margin:auto}
 .level-top{height:125px}.about{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 h1{letter-spacing:-1.7px}.section{padding-top:43px;padding-bottom:50px}
}
@media(max-width:420px){
 .nav-inner{padding:11px 14px}.brand{font-size:14px}.brand-icon{width:37px;height:37px}
 .nav-links{gap:10px}.nav-links a:nth-child(2){display:none}
 .nav-links .pill{padding:10px 12px}
 .hero{padding-left:17px;padding-right:17px}
 .modal-box{padding:18px}.modal-question{font-size:20px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="navbar">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="brand-icon">🚦</span><span>БОЗЖЫРА<br><small style="font-size:10px;color:#71809a;letter-spacing:1.2px">БІЛІМ ӘЛЕМІ</small></span></a>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="#home">Басты бет</a>
      <a href="#levels">Деңгейлер</a>
      <a href="#about">Біз туралы</a>
      <button class="pill" id="navPlay">Ойнау ✨</button>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">✨ ҮЙРЕНУ · ОЙНАУ · ДАМУ</span>
    <h1>Білім ал,<br><span>қауіпсіз</span> жүр!</h1>
    <p>Жол ережелерін қызықты ойындар арқылы үйрен. Әр дұрыс жауап сені қауіпсіздік қаһарманы болуға жақындатады!</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <button class="primary" id="heroPlay">Оқуды бастау →</button>
      <a class="secondary" href="#levels" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center">Деңгейлерді көру ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Жол қауіпсіздігі иллюстрациясы">
    <div class="sun"></div><span class="cloud one">☁️</span><span class="cloud two">☁️</span>
    <div class="land back"></div><div class="land"></div><div class="road"></div>
    <div class="school">🏫</div>
    <div class="floating a">⭐ <span id="heroStars">0</span> жұлдыз</div>
    <div class="floating b">🎯 Қауіпсіздік әлемі</div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-icon">📚</div><div><strong>3</strong><small>Оқу деңгейі</small></div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-icon">❓</div><div><strong>15</strong><small>Қызықты сұрақ</small></div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-icon">⭐</div><div><strong id="totalStars">0</strong><small>Жиналған жұлдыз</small></div></div>
</div>

<section class="section" id="levels">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">🎮 ОЙЫН АЛАҢЫ</span>
    <h2>Өз деңгейіңді таңда!</h2>
    <p>Әр деңгейде бес сұрақ бар. Дұрыс жауап беріп, жаңа жетістіктерге қол жеткіз!</p>
  </div>
  <div class="levels">
    <article class="level-card" data-card="0">
      <div class="level-top t1">🚦</div>
      <h3>Бағдаршам әлемі</h3>
      <p>Бағдаршам түстері мен көшеден дұрыс өту жолдарын үйрен.</p>
      <div class="level-meta"><span>★ <b data-score="0">0</b> / 5</span><span>5 сұрақ</span></div>
      <button class="level-button" data-game="0">Ойнау →</button>
    </article>
    <article class="level-card" data-card="1">
      <div class="level-top t2">🛑</div>
      <h3>Белгілер құпиясы</h3>
      <p>Жол белгілерінің мағынасын тауып, өз біліміңді тексер.</p>
      <div class="level-meta"><span>★ <b data-score="1">0</b> / 5</span><span>5 сұрақ</span></div>
      <button class="level-button" data-game="1">Ойнау →</button>
    </article>
    <article class="level-card" data-card="2">
      <div class="level-top t3">🦸</div>
      <h3>Қауіпсіздік қаһарманы</h3>
      <p>Күнделікті жағдайларда дұрыс шешім қабылдауды үйрен.</p>
      <div class="level-meta"><span>★ <b data-score="2">0</b> / 5</span><span>5 сұрақ</span></div>
      <button class="level-button" data-game="2">Ойнау →</button>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">💙 БІЗ ТУРАЛЫ</span>
    <h2>Үйрену қызықты болсын!</h2>
    <p>Ойын арқылы алған білім күнделікті өмірде дұрыс шешім қабылдауға көмектеседі.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about-card">
      <h3>Біздің мақсатымыз 🎯</h3>
      <p>Балаларға жол қауіпсіздігі ережелерін қарапайым, түсінікті және қызықты түрде үйрету.</p>
      <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">🧠</span><div><b>Оңай үйрену</b><small>Қысқа сұрақтар мен түсінікті жауаптар.</small></div></div>
      <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">⭐</span><div><b>Жетістіктер</b><small>Әр дұрыс жауап үшін жұлдыз жина.</small></div></div>
      <div class="feature"><span class="feature-icon">🚀</span><div><b>Даму</b><small>Қайталап ойнап, нәтижеңді жақсарт.</small></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-note">
      <div class="big-emoji">🌟</div>
      <h3>Сен де қаһарман бол!</h3>
      <p>Жол ережесін білу — өзіңді және айналаңдағы адамдарды қорғаудың маңызды қадамы.</p>
      <button class="primary" id="aboutPlay" style="align-self:flex-start;margin-top:12px;background:#ffcc4d;color:#142344;box-shadow:none">Қазір бастау →</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>© 2026 БОЗЖЫРА · БІЛІМ ӘЛЕМІ · Білім — болашаққа жол! 💙</footer>

<div class="modal" id="gameModal" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-box" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalQuestion">
    <div class="modal-header"><span class="modal-kicker" id="modalKicker">01 / БАҒДАРШАМ ӘЛЕМІ</span><button class="close" id="closeModal" aria-label="Жабу">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal-progress"><div class="modal-progress-fill" id="modalProgressFill"></div></div>
    <div class="modal-art" id="modalArt">🚦</div>
    <h2 class="modal-question" id="modalQuestion">Сұрақ</h2>
    <div class="modal-answers" id="modalAnswers"></div>
    <div class="modal-feedback" id="modalFeedback" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <button class="modal-next" id="modalNext" disabled>Келесі сұрақ →</button>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div>

